{"3669370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Oil", "steam_appid": 3669370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Wasteland </strong>defend your armored rig against endless raiders while drilling deep for vital oil in a brutal post apocalyptic roguelike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/17f56b3fc4ae6dd4e15a9a5bc7f0b975.poster.avif?t=1785653820\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/17f56b3fc4ae6dd4e15a9a5bc7f0b975.webm?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/17f56b3fc4ae6dd4e15a9a5bc7f0b975.mp4?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/7e2123544346d84bd7fc37b5cb6d7131.avif?t=1785653820\" width=1040 height=236 /></span><strong>Drill for Resources </strong>dig beneath your rig to uncover oil and rare metals, but return in time or be caught in the next deadly wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/f7774b794ad0b763f9b57e3881002067.poster.avif?t=1785653820\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/f7774b794ad0b763f9b57e3881002067.webm?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/f7774b794ad0b763f9b57e3881002067.mp4?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/685f85514af3576638b7dd94926ff3af.avif?t=1785653820\" width=1040 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Relentlessly </strong>command powerful defenses to shred swarms of melee attackers, vehicles, and artillery before they tear your rig apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.poster.avif?t=1785653820\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.webm?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.mp4?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/74d4a90d11e9be49dd2f6df16e523d5f.avif?t=1785653820\" width=1040 height=236 /></span><strong>Upgrade to Survive </strong>Turn oil and scrap into upgrades, stronger weapons, tougher armor, faster drills, and sharper radar push your survival skills.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/dcd2871dd36762f8c1a6487bb0232215.poster.avif?t=1785653820\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/dcd2871dd36762f8c1a6487bb0232215.webm?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/dcd2871dd36762f8c1a6487bb0232215.mp4?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drill &amp; Survive</strong> – Mine oil and metals while holding off endless waves of ruthless raiders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong> – Face swarms of melee attackers, armored convoys, and heavy artillery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment with Builds</strong> – Mix weapons, gadgets, and upgrades to create powerful synergies each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replay</strong> – Every run plays differently with new challenges, resources, and survival paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Wasteland </strong>defend your armored rig against endless raiders while drilling deep for vital oil in a brutal post apocalyptic roguelike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/17f56b3fc4ae6dd4e15a9a5bc7f0b975.poster.avif?t=1785653820\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/17f56b3fc4ae6dd4e15a9a5bc7f0b975.webm?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/17f56b3fc4ae6dd4e15a9a5bc7f0b975.mp4?t=1785653820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item